  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"Ux01V\" id=\"Ux01V\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ac1f546\" id=\"u0ac1f546\">学习目标</span></h1><ol list=\"u3f281525\"><li fid=\"ue3060477\" data-lake-id=\"ua33f06c3\" id=\"ua33f06c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u081f0e85\" id=\"u081f0e85\">学会点亮不同接线方式的LED灯</span></li><li fid=\"ue3060477\" data-lake-id=\"u949a1150\" id=\"u949a1150\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c99fade\" id=\"u1c99fade\">认识驱动层的构建思想</span></li><li fid=\"ue3060477\" data-lake-id=\"u1a70a015\" id=\"u1a70a015\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31201ac0\" id=\"u31201ac0\">强化结构体的定义及使用能力</span></li><li fid=\"ue3060477\" data-lake-id=\"ub8fa38da\" id=\"ub8fa38da\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdda43f8\" id=\"ucdda43f8\">强化代码的封装和复用能力</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uba9ac8ab\" id=\"uba9ac8ab\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"y4LBZ\" id=\"y4LBZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52caa2f7\" id=\"u52caa2f7\">点灯的两种方式</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ufae36d34\" id=\"ufae36d34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84547f37\" id=\"u84547f37\">不同颜色LED，达到相同亮度，对应的电压不同，通常需要接入220Ω到10KΩ的限流电阻，阻值越小，LED越亮，反之LED越暗，以下两种方式皆可。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"WnrNq\" id=\"WnrNq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3031031d\" id=\"u3031031d\">灌入电流法</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u6ecee417\" id=\"u6ecee417\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1714920554837-707f7dc8-bdb0-486b-ac7b-32d195361557.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4a0d8e3a-90e4-4601-ad97-38228cec88e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f6679f3-eb68-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A480%2C%22height%22%3A139%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10509%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A480%2C%22originHeight%22%3A139%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPIOPIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LED1%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CC%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221K%22%2C%22x%22%3A99%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udabe0093%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u28cb3b45\" id=\"u28cb3b45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u485adf57\" id=\"u485adf57\">灌入电流接法：LED亮灯供电VCC由芯片外部提供，灌入MCU的GPIO_PIN引脚</span></p><ul list=\"u6a397388\"><li fid=\"ud86e5738\" data-lake-id=\"u56c2c853\" id=\"u56c2c853\"><span data-lake-id=\"u850e3697\" id=\"u850e3697\">优点：可提供较大电压电流，让灯更亮</span></li><li fid=\"ud86e5738\" data-lake-id=\"u1c7de5d0\" id=\"u1c7de5d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f2e556c\" id=\"u3f2e556c\">缺点：外部电源大幅变化时，可能导致MCU引脚烧毁。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"KxbB5\" id=\"KxbB5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba03c10d\" id=\"uba03c10d\">输出电流法</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc1f89c18\" id=\"uc1f89c18\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1714920563044-c598cfa8-0d9f-4538-8d89-0168c86d4e22.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uff144481-a428-4693-99d4-71c883d4b4e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8f6679f3-eb68-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A519%2C%22height%22%3A163%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A12256%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A519%2C%22originHeight%22%3A163%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPIOPIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A73%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A249%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A54%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LED2%22%2C%22x%22%3A377%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A448%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf8f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub980529d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u21479991\" id=\"u21479991\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf57efd4b\" id=\"uf57efd4b\">输出电流法：由MCU提供正极供电，使用推挽输出模式可以让一般LED亮起。通常接小LED用这种接法。</span></p><ul list=\"udac38fc7\"><li fid=\"u0305e46a\" data-lake-id=\"u176d8691\" id=\"u176d8691\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua15bb8f7\" id=\"ua15bb8f7\">优点：安全可控</span></li><li fid=\"u0305e46a\" data-lake-id=\"ue9677edd\" id=\"ue9677edd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a9cf482\" id=\"u0a9cf482\">缺点：驱动能力有限</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uea2b9ad4\" id=\"uea2b9ad4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d3fdf90\" id=\"u4d3fdf90\">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"HyMw7\" id=\"HyMw7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63403b63\" id=\"u63403b63\">扩展板点灯</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ue592c8e2\" id=\"ue592c8e2\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1704175947421-2d91cd67-8534-4765-a01a-3107a0df5396.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7a3fd3c0-142d-4ae8-8e55-baafd05305f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u83ac95fa-a4d8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A792.8888888888889%2C%22height%22%3A392%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%227.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A163556%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1784%2C%22originHeight%22%3A883%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAL%E5%BA%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A512%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E5%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A733%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RCU%22%2C%22x%22%3A929%2C%22y%22%3A527%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A727%2C%22y%22%3A744%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A380%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A531%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LED%22%2C%22x%22%3A389%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A760%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MCU%22%2C%22x%22%3A347%2C%22y%22%3A745%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1110%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1451%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%B2%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1164%2C%22y%22%3A741%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAEEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1440%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A958%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e5e4b2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xb0eT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub1e60635\" id=\"ub1e60635\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06db4241\" id=\"u06db4241\">LED驱动包含什么功能?</span></p><ol list=\"u055d02fb\"><li fid=\"ud66dae1c\" data-lake-id=\"ue6683411\" id=\"ue6683411\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3715ddb2\" id=\"u3715ddb2\">初始化4个LED灯</span></li><li fid=\"ud66dae1c\" data-lake-id=\"uec4dff33\" id=\"uec4dff33\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6975b06\" id=\"ub6975b06\">打开某一个灯</span></li><li fid=\"ud66dae1c\" data-lake-id=\"u5a7f648d\" id=\"u5a7f648d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fddc49b\" id=\"u2fddc49b\">关闭某一个灯</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uac981b57\" id=\"uac981b57\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7b095ef\" id=\"uc7b095ef\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5f0fb36c\" id=\"u5f0fb36c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1715531347570-83ca30b2-754e-47ef-8c3e-2733584a12e5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf7e884f4-086e-497b-abe9-6563e112272%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub6212c98-e007-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A593%2C%22height%22%3A673%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A72424%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A593%2C%22originHeight%22%3A673%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcf9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uef38fd11%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Ks5B4\" id=\"Ks5B4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf282d0bc\" id=\"uf282d0bc\">点灯方式</span></h2><ul list=\"u3128b68f\"><li fid=\"ubab9fa76\" data-lake-id=\"ub1638da8\" id=\"ub1638da8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua263209a\" id=\"ua263209a\">初始化所有IO为推挽输出模式</span></li><li fid=\"ubab9fa76\" data-lake-id=\"u00defff8\" id=\"u00defff8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17342256\" id=\"u17342256\">默认将总开关LED_SW拉高，总开关关闭</span></li><li fid=\"ubab9fa76\" data-lake-id=\"u4da8bc05\" id=\"u4da8bc05\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27e7dee5\" id=\"u27e7dee5\">默认将所有LED1-8拉高，为关闭状态</span></li><li fid=\"ubab9fa76\" data-lake-id=\"uc5409c98\" id=\"uc5409c98\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e03ecff\" id=\"u3e03ecff\">LED_SW总开关拉低导通（三极管为PNP型），所有LED阳极可有供电。</span></li><li fid=\"ubab9fa76\" data-lake-id=\"u86371010\" id=\"u86371010\"><span data-lake-id=\"u594d72c5\" id=\"u594d72c5\">在总开关拉低导通时，任意LED直接拉低自己的IO即可点亮</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u86e40e46\" id=\"u86e40e46\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"WYGq9\" id=\"WYGq9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50e3c474\" id=\"u50e3c474\">点亮LED1-4</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4fa20d0d\" id=\"u4fa20d0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u164deb22\" id=\"u164deb22\">为了能够应对批量初始化的需求，我们可以定义结构体来描述参数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8Egpio%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E6%89%80%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%5Cntypedef%20struct%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctrcu_periph_enum%20rcu%3B%5Cn%5Ctuint32_t%20port%3B%5Cn%5Ctuint32_t%20pin%3B%5Cn%7D%20Led_GPIO_t%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rxx77%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf3a63525\" id=\"uf3a63525\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3e04ac9\" id=\"ub3e04ac9\">进而声明出所有的GPIO对应参数</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89gpio%E5%A